OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly start with patchy
OL,6,Ffrost and fog at first. A dry day
OL,7,Ffollows with light winds and plenty of
OL,8,Fsunshine. Temperatures below average
OL,9,Ffor the time of year.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRemaining dry and mostly
OL,12,Fclear through the evening and
OL,13,Fovernight, with some fog and frost
OL,14,Fforming in rural spots by dawn, as the
OL,15,Fchilly feel continues.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
