OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FAnother bright start with
OL,6,Fplenty of sunshine on Sunday, but some
OL,7,Fcloud will push in from the east at
OL,8,Ftimes, giving an isolated light
OL,9,Fshower. Temperatures still below
OL,10,Faverage.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,13,FShowers, some perhaps heavy, move
OL,14,Fwestwards across the region on Monday.
OL,15,FFurther rain at times into Tuesday and
OL,16,FWednesday, and possibly turning windy
OL,17,Flater. Temperatures moving towards the
OL,18,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
